description=Ace 6T ODM HW pack for 15R firmware. Camera: macan sensors, EIS tables, DNG profiles, front (resolutions, FOV, night, restore). Battery 8300: power profile, devices config, fastchg tables, thermal profiles. Sensors: rotation detect, mxg4300. Overlayfs via odm.img, reboot required.
